		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4806&amp;p=35411#p35411"><![CDATA[
Just in time!  I received a new V4A on Sunday and only spent enough time with the OEM f/w and CPS to do a backup.  Immediately jumped through the usual hoops (download this, update CPS, etc, etc.) and used it to check into 2 nets on Sunday night (one FM, one DMR).<br><br>Nice to not have to deal with more than one codeplug and CPS, despite having two different radios (UV380 and 9600). Certainly, the different use cases for the two radios means a little tweaking here &amp; there, but I use a spreadsheet to make changes, export to csv files, import and write to radio.<br><br>Tahnk you!<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5571">N0JYZ</a> — Mon Jan 27, 2025 8:57 pm</p><hr />
